@baseUrl = http://localhost:51820

### Presence capabilities (legacy /health remains protocol 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/health

### Start a managed run, initially Idle
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "protocolVersion": 2,
  "kind": "started",
  "eventId": "8e2e7fe5-7eee-4790-a548-e9ff6e033b96",
  "machineId": "cb148458-81b1-401d-9c9e-6b342e09d602",
  "machineName": "example-computer",
  "client": "copilot-cli",
  "clientVersion": "1.0",
  "generation": 1,
  "sequence": 1,
  "reportedAtUtc": "2026-09-15T18:00:00Z",
  "heartbeatIntervalSeconds": 300,
  "sessions": []
}

### Invalid lifecycle: cannot start an unknown generation with offline (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "protocolVersion": 2,
  "kind": "offline",
  "eventId": "2da5e6bc-f833-477c-8e7e-cb83ea66e19e",
  "machineId": "cb148458-81b1-401d-9c9e-6b342e09d602",
  "machineName": "example-computer",
  "client": "copilot-cli",
  "clientVersion": "1.0",
  "generation": 2,
  "sequence": 1,
  "reportedAtUtc": "2026-09-15T18:01:00Z"
}
